[2026-08-17T20:41:25.920Z] Possible reasons for having these kinds of units are:
[2026-08-17T20:41:25.920Z] • A unit may be statically enabled by being symlinked from another unit's
[2026-08-17T20:41:25.920Z]   .wants/, .requires/, or .upholds/ directory.
